-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"א/3: קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"א
-- The clothing allowance for school year 2010/11 (תשע"א): who is entitled,
-- the amount by teaching seniority, the extra allowance for physical-education
-- teachers and for technological-education staff, pro-rating by position, and
-- the month it is paid in; pro-rating between employers and the 140% limit.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"א/3 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"א`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, the circular's title, addressee, subject line and the opening words "according to the Treasury's instructions on the clothing allowance, act as follows"; the rules are sections א–ג.

@desc A teaching employee's school year 2010/11, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing year` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc the employee is graded in the teaching-staff grade (דירוג עובדי הוראה)
    `years of teaching seniority`        IS A NUMBER  @desc seniority in teaching (ותק בהוראה), in years
    `position fraction`                  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held at this employer (1 = one full position)
    `position at all employers`          IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held at all employers together
    `teaches physical education`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `physical-education employment rate` IS A NUMBER  @desc the employment rate (שיעור העסקה) section ב's table is read by; see F-2010-11_tashaa_03-c
    `in technological education`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching employee in technological education or a professional instructor (מדריך מקצועי)
    `technological professions taught`   IS A LIST OF STRING @desc the professions taught, as section ג's lists print them

@desc The things section ג grants in kind.
DECLARE `clothing item` IS ONE OF
    `a pair of shoes`
    `a robe`

DECLARE `clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance` HAS `amount of clothing allowance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `work beyond 140% of a position`

§§ `א קצובת ביגוד – כללי`

-- "יש לשלמה במלואה": the allowance is paid whole, in one payment, with the
-- July 2011 salary; "במלואה" is read as one payment, not as setting aside
-- section א.5's pro-rating, which the same section states in the same breath.
-- Time is counted in school months of 2010/11 (common.l4: September = 1).
@ref akn:art_a__para_1
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `payment with July's salary` y IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance` `amount paid`
          PROVIDED `amount paid` AT LEAST `clothing allowance` y
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section א.1: the clothing allowance is paid in full with the July 2011 salary"

-- "כנהוג כלפי מקבלי קהל בשירות המדינה": the measure is the civil service's
-- for staff who receive the public; this circular prints the amounts itself.
@ref akn:art_a__para_2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance` y IF
    y's `in the teaching-staff grade`

`the school year this circular prices` MEANS "תשע\"א (September 2010 to August 2011)"

-- Section א.4's table AS PRINTED, in the printed order.
@ref akn:art_a__para_3 akn:art_a__para_4
DECLARE `seniority band` HAS
    `from seniority year` IS A NUMBER
    `to seniority year`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה", with no upper bound
    `band amount`         IS A NUMBER  @desc shekels for a full position

`the seniority table` MEANS
    LIST `seniority band` 1  25  1464,
         `seniority band` 26 999 2042

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the seniority table gives for` n IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from seniority year` AND n AT MOST b's `to seniority year`)
                `the seniority table`)

-- F-2010-11_tashaa_03-a: the table opens at year 1. The reading adopted
-- counts the year being served, so a first-year employee is in year 1.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full-position amount by seniority` y IS
    IF y's `years of teaching seniority` AT LEAST 26
    THEN 2042
    ELSE 1464

`a first-year employee has no row if seniority counts completed years` MEANS
    `the amounts the seniority table gives for` 0 EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `a first-year employee has no row if seniority counts completed years`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the amounts the seniority table gives for` n) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 1, 2, 10, 25, 26, 30, 40)

-- Section א.5 caps the share at one full position; section א.6: where the
-- positions at several employers total more than 100%, each employer pays
-- the share of the position held with it, so the cap is read per employer.
@ref akn:art_a__para_5 akn:art_a__para_6
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position share` y IS
    min (y's `position fraction`) 1

-- Section א.7: no more than 140% of a position at all employers together,
-- and section א.6 is no permission to employ beyond it.
@ref akn:art_a__para_7
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `the 140% limit` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    SHANT `work beyond 140% of a position`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "section א.7: no teaching employee works beyond 140% of a position at all employers together"

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the 140% limit` y IF
    y's `position at all employers` AT MOST 1.4

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `general clothing allowance` y IS
    IF `entitled to the clothing allowance` y
    THEN `full-position amount by seniority` y TIMES `position share` y
    ELSE 0

§§ `ב קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- Section ב's table AS PRINTED ("סכום נכון ל-1/9/10"): "עד 0.3", "מ-0.3 עד
-- 0.5", "מ-0.5 ומעלה". Its bounds meet at 0.3 and at 0.5 (F-2010-11_tashaa_03-b).
@ref akn:art_b
DECLARE `employment band` HAS
    `from employment rate` IS A NUMBER
    `to employment rate`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `employment band amount` IS A NUMBER

`the physical-education table` MEANS
    LIST `employment band` 0   0.3 0,
         `employment band` 0.3 0.5 252,
         `employment band` 0.5 999 501

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` r IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `employment band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD r AT LEAST b's `from employment rate` AND r AT MOST b's `to employment rate`)
                `the physical-education table`)

-- The reading adopted (F-2010-11_tashaa_03-b): the band that OPENS at a
-- bound ("מ-") governs it, so 0.3 takes 252 and 0.5 takes 501.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance` y IS
    IF y's `teaches physical education`
    THEN BRANCH IF y's `physical-education employment rate` AT LEAST 0.5 THEN 501
                IF y's `physical-education employment rate` AT LEAST 0.3 THEN 252
                OTHERWISE 0
    ELSE 0

`the physical-education table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each` MEANS
        `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 252
    AND `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 252, 501
#ASSERT `the physical-education table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD count (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` r) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.49, 0.51, 1)

-- F-2010-11_tashaa_03-c: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the employee's whole position.
`a full-position teacher with a fifth in physical education` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS 10
        `position fraction`                  IS 1
        `position at all employers`          IS 1
        `teaches physical education`         IS TRUE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS 0.2
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `technological professions taught`   IS EMPTY

`the two readings of the employment rate differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.2
         EQUALS `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ`

§§ `ג קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

-- Section ג's lead-in names the school year "תש\"ע", the year before the one
-- this circular is for (title, section א.2: תשע"א); read as this circular's
-- year, the evident one.
-- Section ג.1א's thirteen professions, in the printed order of their numbers.
@ref akn:art_c/p1 akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a
`the professions granted shoes and two robes` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות תעופה",
         "מכטרוניקה",
         "טרמודינמיקה וטכנית ימית",
         "מערכות סיב\"מ ותיב\"מ",
         "תחזוקת מערכות מכניות",
         "מערכות מכונאות רכב",
         "מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב",
         "מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה",
         "מערכות בקרת אקלים",
         "אומנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית",
         "ימאות – ספינות",
         "מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע",
         "מערכות צילום"

-- The value line printed under ג.1א: "ערך זוג נעליים ושני חלוקים: 535 ₪".
`the value of shoes and two robes` MEANS 535

-- Section ג.1ב's thirteen professions.
@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b
`the professions granted two robes` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות אלקטרוניות",
         "מערכות מחשוב ובקרה",
         "מערכות מחשבים",
         "תכנון ותכנות מערכות",
         "מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה",
         "ניהול תיירותי",
         "ניהול מלונאי",
         "חינוך לגיל הרך",
         "עיצוב",
         "אופנה ותלבושות",
         "עיצוב שיער, וטיפוח החן",
         "סיעוד",
         "אומנות שימושית"

@ref akn:art_c__para_2
`the value of two robes` MEANS 331

GIVEN professions IS A LIST OF STRING
      y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaches a profession on` professions y IF
        y's `in technological education`
    AND any (GIVEN p YIELD elem p professions) (y's `technological professions taught`)

-- Each subparagraph grants on its own words; an employee teaching on both
-- lists meets both, and the text grants both.
@ref akn:art_c__para_3 akn:art_c__para_4
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological clothing allowance` y IS
    (   (IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted shoes and two robes` y
         THEN `the value of shoes and two robes`
         ELSE 0)
     PLUS (IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted two robes` y
           THEN `the value of two robes`
           ELSE 0))
    TIMES `position share` y

-- akn:art_d The contact line for questions (the conditions-of-service unit's telephone numbers); no rule.

@export default The clothing allowance one employer owes a teaching employee for school year 2010/11 under circular תשע"א/3, the general allowance plus the physical-education and technological-education additions
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year` @desc the employee's school year 2010/11 at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing allowance` y IS
    `general clothing allowance` y
    PLUS `physical-education allowance` y
    PLUS `technological clothing allowance` y

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

-- Worked examples, on the circular's own amounts.
`a half-position teacher in year 30` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS 30
        `position fraction`                  IS 0.5
        `position at all employers`          IS 0.5
        `teaches physical education`         IS FALSE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `technological professions taught`   IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a half-position teacher in year 30` EQUALS 1021

`a nursing teacher at two employers, 0.8 here` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS 5
        `position fraction`                  IS 0.8
        `position at all employers`          IS 1.4
        `teaches physical education`         IS FALSE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS TRUE
        `technological professions taught`   IS LIST "סיעוד"

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a nursing teacher at two employers, 0.8 here` EQUALS 1436
#ASSERT `within the 140% limit` `a nursing teacher at two employers, 0.8 here`

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a full-position teacher with a fifth in physical education` EQUALS 1464

#TRACE `payment with July's salary` `a half-position teacher in year 30` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 1021 AT 11
#TRACE `payment with July's salary` `a half-position teacher in year 30` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 1021 AT 12
#TRACE `the 140% limit` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `work beyond 140% of a position` AT 3
